build/

# NOTE: pubspec.lock is deliberately NOT ignored.
# This is an application, not a package. Committing the lock pins the exact
# resolved versions so every machine and CI run builds identically.
# (An unpinned `dio` silently moving 5.7 -> 5.11 added a new enum value and
# broke the build; a committed lock prevents that class of surprise.)

